  "behavior": [
    "Widen Keywords u32 to u64, retaining all low32 bit values and numeric JSON encoding. Five named WUBRG protection flags and named DECAYED; no numeric keyword authorship.",
    "Use one targeting source-quality query for chosen spell face in preflight/on stack, exact live ability source (including copy/color changes), or frozen actual departure LKI; never follow a later incarnation.",
    "Protection participates in legal target selection including own-controller effects, pairwise blocking, preventable combat/noncombat damage and affected-controller replacement/prevention order, Equipment attachment, Aura entry and later attachment SBAs using live Aura colors.",
    "CounterKind::Decayed uses the existing sparse layer-six keyword-counter timestamps and removal ordering; printed/copied/granted Decayed forbids blocking and queues one intrinsic attack ability per declared attack.",
    "Decayed attack packet is counterable and creates a source-independent owned end-combat delayed sacrifice through the existing delayed-sacrifice batch. Controller is frozen from attack ability, subject is exact incarnation; copy/ability loss do not undo a queued delay, theft prevents foreign sacrifice, reentry/reused token slots never rebind.",
    "Regular delayed next-end-step sacrifice behavior is retained and its wire shape omits end_combat=false."
  ],
  "focused_outcomes": [
    "ability_targeting_rechecks_current_source_color_and_uses_exact_departure_lki_without_rebinding",
    "actual_and_funding_attachment_worlds_requalify_after_virtual_provider_departure",
    "colored_protection_blocks_matching_creatures_and_prevents_both_damage_kinds_but_not_unpreventable_damage",
    "colored_protection_targeting_checks_all_five_colors_for_both_controllers_before_payment",
    "decayed_counter_payment_is_projected_and_printed_or_copied_decayed_has_both_parts",
    "decayed_delayed_sacrifice_retains_attack_controller_exact_incarnation_and_token_slot",
    "decayed_sacrifices_once_per_attack_after_counter_removal_but_gaining_it_after_attack_is_not_retroactive",
    "delayed_attack_and_end_combat_packets_are_counterable_and_owned_raw_index_restore_are_deterministic",
    "keyword_widening_retains_old_numeric_wire_values_and_records_hot_layout",
    "layer_six_suppression_removes_protection_and_decayed_then_later_counter_grant_restores_only_decayed",
    "paid_chosen_omen_face_uses_red_spell_qualities_instead_of_green_physical_card",
    "protection_from_each_color_rejects_aura_entry_and_equipment_then_cleans_later_color_changes",
    "protection_participates_in_affected_players_prevention_replacement_order_and_preserves_shields"
  ],
